{1}{Welcome @PCNAME@! I am he who is called The Tempter of Fate. Your servant, honored Master.}{Welcome @PCNAME@! I am he who is called The Tempter of Fate. Your servant, honored Mistress.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{You know me?}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{Yuu know me?}{}{-4}{}{5}{}
{4}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{5}{Indeed I do. I have been following your progress for some time now and I'm most impressed with what I've seen. That is why my services are yours to command.}{Indeed I do. I have been following your progress for some time now and I'm most impressed with what I've seen. That is why my services are yours to command.}{}{}{}{}
{6}{What kind of services do you provide?}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Whut services?}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
{8}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{9}{I buy, sell, and exchange the points that the Fates have been gracious enough to grant you.}{I buy, sell, and exchange the points that the Fates have been gracious enough to grant you.}{}{}{}{}
{10}{I need a little explaination here. Fate Points and exchange?}{}{5}{}{13}{}
{11}{Me not unnerstand. Whut 'bout Fate Points an' x-change?}{}{-4}{}{22}{}
{12}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{13}{For deeds of exceptional quality, the Fates grant you a point that you may use when you need that extra little something to carry the day. As for myself, I have the ability to transmute those points into the points of the Character, as they are commonly known.}{For deeds of exceptional quality, the Fates grant you a point that you may use when you need that extra little something to carry the day. As for myself, I have the ability to transmute those points into the points of the Character, as they are commonly known.}{}{}{}{}
{14}{I see... Go on.}{}{5}{}{110}{}
{15}{I don't believe I'm interested. Thanks for your time.}{}{5}{}{17}{}
{16}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{17}{As you know, the Fates have given you an advantageous opportunity! Will you just walk away?}{As you know, the Fates have given you an advantageous opportunity! Will you just walk away?}{}{}{}{}
{18}{Y:}{}{1}{}{0}{fl20}
{19}{N:}{}{1}{}{38}{}
{20}{As you wish, Master @PCNAME@.}{As you wish, Mistress @PCNAME@.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{22}{Then I shall explain in terms you can understand. There are these beings, called the Fates, and when you do something special, they grant you a point that you can use to help when you really need to do something.}{Then I shall explain in terms you can understand. There are these beings, called the Fates, and when you do something special, they grant you a point that you can use to help when you really need to do something.}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Uhh... OK}{}{-4}{}{24}{}
{24}{Now I have the power to change those Fate Points into points of the Character, as they are commonly known. These you can use for more strength, or intelligence, or whatever you desire more of.}{Now I have the power to change those Fate Points into points of the Character, as they are commonly known. These you can use for more strength, or intelligence, or whatever you desire more of.}{}{}{}{}
{25}{Ahhh! I see now! Go on. Tell me more.}{}{-4}{}{28}{}
