{28}{The exchange rate is two Fate Points for one Character Point. One to change and one for myself as compensation for my time and effort.}{The exchange rate is two Fate Points for one Character Point. One to change and one for myself as compensation for my time and effort.}{}{}{}{}
{29}{Seems reasonable. And you buy and sell these points as well?}{}{5}{}{34}{}
{30}{OK. Dat makes sense. An' you said you buy and sell dese Fate Points too?}{}{-4}{}{34}{}
{31}{I don't believe I'm interested. Thanks for your time.}{}{5}{}{17}{}
