{33}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{34}{Indeed. Should you find yourself with a surplus of these little bonuses, I shall gladly purchase them at the rate of 750 gold per point. Then, with a small mark-up for my time and effort, I resell them to those in need for a mere 1000 gold.}{Indeed. Should you find yourself with a surplus of these little bonuses, I shall gladly purchase them at the rate of 750 gold per point. Then, with a small mark-up for my time and effort, I resell them to those in need for a mere 1000 gold.}{}{}{}{}
{35}{Must be a good business. I think I have heard all I need to.}{}{5}{}{38}{}
